### Sistema de Follows - Tests Backend

# Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3013/api/social
@authToken = TU_TOKEN_AQUI
@userId1 = 676e737b123456789abcdef1
@userId2 = 676e737b123456789abcdef2
@targetUserId = 676e737b123456789abcdef3

### 1. Seguir a un usuario
POST {{baseUrl}}/follows
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "targetUserId": "{{targetUserId}}"
}

### 2. Dejar de seguir a un usuario
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/follows
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "targetUserId": "{{targetUserId}}"
}

### 3. Obtener estadísticas de follows de un usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/follows/{{targetUserId}}/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Obtener estadísticas con viewerId específico
GET {{baseUrl}}/follows/{{targetUserId}}/stats?viewerId={{userId1}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Listar seguidores de un usuario
GET {{baseUrl}}/follows/{{targetUserId}}/followers
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 6. Listar seguidores con paginación
GET {{baseUrl}}/follows/{{targetUserId}}/followers?limit=10&cursor=2024-01-15T10:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Listar usuarios que sigue
GET {{baseUrl}}/follows/{{targetUserId}}/following
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Listar usuarios que sigue con paginación
GET {{baseUrl}}/follows/{{targetUserId}}/following?limit=10&cursor=2024-01-15T10:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Obtener sugerencias de usuarios para seguir
GET {{baseUrl}}/follows/suggestions
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 10. Obtener sugerencias con límite específico
GET {{baseUrl}}/follows/suggestions?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Intentar seguirse a sí mismo (debería fallar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/follows
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "targetUserId": "{{userId1}}"
}

### 12. Seguir a usuario inexistente (debería fallar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/follows
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "targetUserId": "123456789012345678901234"
}

### 13. Seguir a usuario ya seguido (debería fallar)
POST {{baseUrl}}/follows
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "targetUserId": "{{targetUserId}}"
}

### 14. Dejar de seguir a usuario no seguido (debería fallar)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/follows
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "targetUserId": "123456789012345678901234"
}

### 15. Test con datos inválidos - ID muy corto
POST {{baseUrl}}/follows
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "targetUserId": "123"
}

### 16. Test con datos inválidos - ID muy largo
POST {{baseUrl}}/follows
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "targetUserId": "123456789012345678901234567890"
}

### 17. Test sin targetUserId
POST {{baseUrl}}/follows
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
}